    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60680" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύλα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
				parts under the eyes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ. τοῦ προσώπου
			ἐξερυθριᾷ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ κ. τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν ὑπόχλωρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.44
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυλάδες</span></b> , αἱ, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1951.18
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυλίς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.66
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύλλαβοι, κύλλια</span>,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> sg., <i>groove above
				upper eyelid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦλον</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.378
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῖλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			, freq. as v.l., cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.38
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠλ</span>- in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυλοιδιάω</span>.)</div>
